                        - listitem [ref=e1365]: Make Cardano easier to build on and use
                        - listitem [ref=e1366]: Make Cardano a competitive option
                        - listitem [ref=e1367]: Create clear funding mechanisms
                        - listitem [ref=e1368]: Make Cardano more recognizable
                      - paragraph [ref=e1369]: –
