                        - listitem [ref=e1373]: Validate which use cases Cardano is best suited for (and which it's not)
                        - listitem [ref=e1374]: Map personas and journeys for dApp teams, enterprises, and community members
                        - listitem [ref=e1375]: Clarify gaps in governance awareness and participation
                        - listitem [ref=e1376]: Offer comparative insights from other ecosystems to identify opportunities
